  glowTitle: ["余晖引航", "Afterglow Passage"], glowService: ["灯塔邮班", "Lighthouse service"], glowMap: ["白沙灯历", "White Sand light table"],
  glowAccess: ["白沙灯塔航图，选水格查看它每一闪的光照", "White Sand chart. Select a square to read its light on every flash."],
  glowBrief: ["我在塔窗摆了一只小瓶，装着上一闪没散尽的光。你只管划，经过一格就放一盏纸灯。等水面连成一行，我就知道是哪条船来了。", "I left a little bottle in the lantern window. It holds the last light from a passing flash. Float a paper lantern each time you row. When I see the trail on the water, I’ll know it’s you."],
  glowIntro: ["第 {n} 闪到 {box} 投信。每闪划一格，灯旁可等候。整趟可借一次余晖，划进虚线格。", "Reach {box} on flash {n}. Row one square per flash or wait at a beacon. Use the bottle once to enter a dashed square."],
  glowRulesTitle: ["怎样读灯", "Reading the lights"],
  glowRules: ["金色实线照着这一闪能划进的水面。全程有一瓶余晖，能划进上一闪还亮着的虚线格。三盏灯每闪转四分之一圈，光遇圆镜会拐弯。只能上下左右划，经过的水格留着纸灯，不能折返。点任意水格查整晚的灯历，翻看其他闪次时船会等你。", "Gold beams light the water you can enter on this flash. Your one bottle also lets you enter a dashed square that was lit on the previous flash. Each lantern turns a quarter-turn per flash. Mirrors bend its beam. Row one square up, down, left or right. Your wake holds paper lanterns, so each square can be entered only once. Select any square to read its light table. Looking ahead leaves the boat where it is."],
