  duetAwaitScore: ["两封信各自接通信箱后，就能试听和逐拍查看。", "Connect each letter to its box to play or scrub the score."],
  duetReachBoth: ["两封都到菱印了。盖好合印，出发钟会从第 0 拍重新计时。", "Both letters are at the desk. Stamp them to set the departure clock to beat zero."],
  duetNeedDock: ["先转圆镜，把两封信都接到菱印 {cell}。", "Turn the mirrors to bring both letters to the desk at {cell}."],
  duetNeedBoxes: ["两封信从菱印出发。选好去向，需要时换一面镜，把它们分别送到自己的信箱。", "Leave from the desk. Set each heading and, if needed, change one mirror to reach each letter’s own box."],
  duetOffbeat: ["月信第 {moon} 拍到，星信第 {star} 拍到。拖动出发间隔，再听两声回信。", "Moon arrives on beat {moon}, star on beat {star}. Change the departure gap and listen again."],
