  hillReturnNote: ["司机夹好四张票根，递来两张挨着的回程票。背面有行熟悉的小字：「靠窗的留给你。」", "The driver clips the four stubs together and hands over two seats side by side. On the back, in familiar handwriting, it says “I saved you the window.”"],
  hillToWallet: ["查看票夹 ↓", "Ticket wallet ↓"], hillToChart: ["回到航图 ↑", "Back to chart ↑"],
  hillVia: ["在 {cells} 转向。", "It turns at {cells}."],
  hillBrief: ["信要经过坡顶和坡脚的邮戳。圆镜能转向，方框道岔里可以装岔镜。两片岔镜由你调配，每条走通的邮路都有一张自己的车票。", "Take the letter through both hillside stamps. Turn the round mirrors and fit either of your two switch mirrors into the square sockets. Each distinct journey earns its own ticket."],
