  watchBook: ["听测手簿", "Listening log"], watchEmpty: ["听测一次，岸灯的位置和回声就会记在这里。", "Make a call to log its shore lamp and the reply."],
  watchPossibilities: ["剩 {n} 种镜向", "{n} possible layouts"], watchCalls: ["已测 {n} 灯", "{n} lamps tested"],
  watchPossibilitiesOne: ["剩 1 种镜向", "1 possible layout"], watchCallsOne: ["已测 1 灯", "1 lamp tested"],
  watchCallCount: ["{n} 次听测", "{n} calls"], watchCallCountOne: ["1 次听测", "1 call"],
  watchTurnCount: ["修镜 {n} 步", "{n} repair turns"], watchTurnCountOne: ["修镜 1 步", "1 repair turn"],
  watchReadMirror: ["这面镜的线索", "Clues for a mirror"],
  watchProofFound: ["{entries}。仅凭这些记录，就能确定 {cell} 的镜面从{slope}。", "{entries}. These readings show that {cell} runs from {slope}."],
  watchProofOpen: ["现有记录容许 {cell} 朝两种方向。还有 {rising} 种草图为 ／，{falling} 种为 ＼。", "Both angles at {cell} fit these calls. The remaining sketches split into ／ {rising} and ＼ {falling}."],
  watchFits: ["✓ 纸图吻合", "✓ Fits sketch"], watchDiffers: ["≠ 纸图有别", "≠ Differs"],
  watchShowTrace: ["叠图", "Overlay"], watchHideTrace: ["收起叠图", "Hide overlay"],
  watchGuide: ["听测方法", "How to read the fog"],
  watchGuide1: ["雾盖住虚线镜，点镜修改纸上的推测。淡紫虚线是所选岸灯在纸上的预计光路。实测沿真实镜向行进，两枚铃各报第一次响起的顺序，最后记下回光来自哪一岸、信箱，或无回光。", "Tap a dashed mirror to pencil in a different angle. The lilac line predicts the selected lamp’s path on your sketch. A real call follows the hidden mirrors. Each bell rings on its first visit, followed by the return shore, the mailbox, or no return."],
  watchGuide2: ["同一盏岸灯可免费重听。换个方向发光，把不同记录放在一起，直到只剩一种镜向。照记录改好草图，就能核验、登桥修镜。", "Repeating a call is free. Try another lamp and combine its report with the earlier ones until one layout remains. Make your sketch match those reports, then verify it to step onto the pier."],
  watchGuide3: ["修镜时光从原来的月灯出发，依次经过 1、2 号铃才可寄信。点手簿中的记录能叠回交班时的光路。每一班分别记录听测和修镜的个人最佳。", "For delivery the original moon lamp must ring 1, then 2, and reach the box. Select an entry to overlay that call’s path before repairs. Each watch keeps personal bests for calls and mirror turns."],
  watchListen: ["发出听测", "Send call"], watchRelisten: ["重听此灯", "Replay call"], watchVerify: ["核验镜位", "Verify sketch"],
  watchFirst: ["选岸灯后发出听测。点虚线镜可以先试画它的方向。", "Choose a lamp and send a call. Tap dashed mirrors to try an angle on paper."],
  watchCallHint: ["试试{port}，不同回声会分别留下 {groups} 种可能。", "Try {port}. Its different replies would leave groups of {groups} possible layouts."],
  watchPencilHint: ["对照{entries}的记录，改画 {cell} 的镜向。", "Check the reports from {entries} and turn the pencil mirror at {cell}."],
  watchConflict: ["有 {n} 条记录和纸图不合。可以改画虚线镜，也可以先换岸灯听测。", "{n} logged reports disagree with the sketch. Turn a dashed mirror or call from another shore."],
  watchConflictOne: ["有 1 条记录和纸图不合。可以改画虚线镜，也可以先换岸灯听测。", "One report disagrees with the sketch. Turn a dashed mirror or call from another shore."],
  watchNeedMore: ["目前的记录和纸图都吻合。换一盏灯，分辨其余可能。", "The sketch fits every report so far. Try another lamp to distinguish the remaining layouts."],
  watchOneLeft: ["回声已经锁定一种镜向。点虚线镜，把纸图改到每条记录都吻合。", "The calls isolate one layout. Turn dashed mirrors until the sketch fits every report."],
  watchProven: ["纸图和唯一的镜向吻合，可以核验、登桥修镜了。", "Your sketch matches the only possible layout. Verify it to start repairs."],
  watchRepairHelp: ["现在转动的是栈桥上的真镜。让月光先响 1 号铃、再响 2 号铃，最后照进信箱。", "Now you’re turning the real mirrors. Send moonlight through bell 1, then bell 2, and into the box."],
  watchOverlayOn: ["淡紫虚线是听测时的光路，金线是修镜后的邮路。", "Lilac dashes trace the original call. Gold follows the mail after your repairs."],
  watchFixHint: ["试着调 {cell} 的真镜，再看月光经过哪枚铃。", "Turn the real mirror at {cell} and follow the moonlight to the bells."],
  watchSendReady: ["两枚铃依次响过了，信箱也亮了。可以寄出回信。", "Both bells rang in order and the mailbox is lit. Send the reply."],
  watchSend: ["寄出雾中回信", "Send fog mail"], watchSigned: ["本班已签收", "Watch signed"],
  watchRetry: ["重试本班", "Retry watch"], watchNext: ["换一班雾", "Next watch"],
  watchSlipTitle: ["栈桥交班条", "Pier handover slip"], watchSlip: ["雾班 {shift} · {calls}，{turns}。", "Watch {shift} · {calls}, {turns}."],
  watchBest: ["个人最佳为 {c}、{m}。本班最少可用 {p}、{q}。", "Personal bests are {c} and {m}. The separate minima for this watch are {p} and {q}."],
  watchDelivered: ["已送达 · 雾班签收", "Delivered on fog watch"],
  watchStory: ["电话里先是风，接着传来两声玻璃轻响。你还没说话，我就知道栈桥的灯又亮了。", "First I heard wind on the telephone, then two taps of glass. Before you said a word I knew the lights were back on at the pier."],
  watchBrief: ["今天的交班条被雾打湿了，有几面镜子的方向看不清。对岸的人守着电话，答应替你听铃，再告诉你哪边有回光。", "The mist soaked the handover slip and blurred a few mirror angles. A friend across the pier is waiting by the telephone to report the bells and which shore lights up."],
  watchMode_relaxed: ["三面镜藏在雾里，每一步都有发灯、画镜或修镜指引。", "Three mirrors are hidden. Each call, pencil change and repair has a guide."],
  watchMode_standard: ["三面雾镜和四盏岸灯。按需提示会依据手头的回声推荐下一盏灯。", "Three hidden mirrors and four shore lamps. Optional hints use the reports you already have."],
  watchMode_expert: ["独立栈桥航图，四面雾镜、五盏岸灯。听测和修镜都由你独立判断。", "A different pier chart, four hidden mirrors and five shore lamps. Deduce the layout and plan the repairs yourself."],
  deskTitle: ["邮路调度台", "Dispatch desk"], deskLocal: ["调度这条邮路", "Dispatch this route"],
  deskAlbumLink: ["回到熟悉的渡口，试试另一种送法。", "Revisit a familiar landing and try a different crossing."],
