  deskMode_standard: ["自行安排航线，需要时再看当前委托的下一步。", "Plan your own sailing. Ask for the next move toward the chosen order at any time."],
  deskMode_expert: ["独立的镜阵、泊位和委托限额。可自由试航，由你独立找出送法。", "A different chart, moorings and order limits. Experiment freely and find the sailings on your own."],
